{
  "slug": "chat-namer",
  "name": "Chat Namer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Name, search, and resume your Claude Code conversations. Automatically names every conversation from the first message via a Stop\nhook. Provides slash commands to list, search, rename, and find conversations to resume. Includes standalone CLI. Zero dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `auto-name` (Auto-name all unnamed conversations from their first message), `list` (List all Claude Code conversations with their names, dates, and message counts), `rename` (Rename a conversation by its number or UUID prefix), `resume` (Find and resume a previous conversation by name or keyword instead of UUID), `search` (Search conversations by name or content keyword)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install chat-namer@claude-community` from `Jamaalx/claude-chat-namer`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 1
  },
